# Goblin Firebomb: "{7}, {T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Destroy target permanent." The sacrifice is a cost, paid as it is
# activated (CR 602.2b, 601.2h), so the Firebomb is gone whatever the ability does; "destroy" does nothing to an indestructible
# permanent (CR 702.12b). On turn 3 Bot1 pays seven (Black Lotus for three, four Moxen) aimed at Bot2's Darksteel Citadel, which
# stays; the Firebomb is in the graveyard.

